# Gere um token com: dotnet user-jwts create --project src/Services/Consent/CareFlow.Consent.Api --scope "consent.read consent.write" --claim tenant_id=11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111 -o token
# Use o patientRef devolvido pelo Patient Vault (dados sintéticos).
@host = http://localhost:5144
@token = cole-o-token-aqui
@patientRef = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Conceder a finalidade de agendamento
PUT {{host}}/v1/patients/{{patientRef}}/consents/scheduling
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "legalBasis": "specific-consent", "termVersion": "2026-10" }

### Situação do paciente
GET {{host}}/v1/patients/{{patientRef}}/consents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Revogar (propaga ConsentRevoked; a agenda cancela as consultas futuras)
POST {{host}}/v1/patients/{{patientRef}}/consents/scheduling/revoke
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
